{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh -lc 'diff -u clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-system.txt clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-system.txt; diff -u clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-closing.txt clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-closing.txt'","aggregated_output":"--- clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c8-system.txt\t2026-11-08 11:02:42\n+++ clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/arms/c17-system.txt\t2026-11-13 11:45:49\n@@ -99,7 +99,9 @@\n   utility have guaranteed for its project companies' loans at its next annual report?\"; \"will the retailer sign a guarantee for its\n   franchisees' leases, large enough to change its credit risk, by the check date?\"). Its own borrowing or leases and a completed\n   or unsized investment are not obligations.\n-- shared_quantity: a quantity or price outside any one company that several companies depend on, for this or next calendar year:\n+- shared_quantity: a quantity or price outside any one company that several companies depend on, for one calendar year, this year or next (a\n+  figure over a rolling twelve months or a span that is not one calendar year is not this reason's period; whether its statement is kept is judged\n+  as evidence):\n   several companies' combined output or spending, a contract price, an interest rate (\"the largest container lines' combined capacity\n   added in 2026\"; \"next year's average contract price of a raw material\"). Another population or wording of the same aggregate is\n   evidence for it.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
